text = "I had no idea where I was. I just saw a figure by the throne. He stated, I had to do two things to ensure my family's health, I 
had to beat 7 fighters. The second was since this was a fight in hell. I had to start this battle in a skeleton like form. 
This would make me weaker at the beginning, but every fight I won, I would gain more of myself. If I got beaten by a fighter,
 it would be game over for my family and I. "

